     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Natural combinations",
     "texto": [
      "A **colocación** is a combination that sounds habitual to speakers. For example, **festival perdana** means \"inaugural festival\" and **pemandangan alam** is \"natural landscape\".",
      "Do not translate each combination word by word: learn which words usually go together, the way in English we say \"scenic view\" and not \"beautiful view\" for the same idea."
     ],
